# API Changelog v1 vs. v1


## API Changes

### PATCH /search
-  for the `cookie` request parameter `id`, the `type` was widened from `array<integer/int64>` to `any`




## Components
- :warning: the component security scheme `oauth` oauth `authorizationCode` flow token url changed from `https://auth.example.com/token` to `https://auth0.example.com/tokenUrl`
- :warning: the component security scheme `oauth` oauth `clientCredentials` flow token url changed from `https://auth.example.com/token` to `https://auth0.example.com/tokenUrl`




